msgid "Using Out Of Date Java"
msgstr "Устаревшая версия Java"

msgid ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>The launcher "
"requires at least Java {0} to run.<br/><br/>The launcher can install this "
"automatically for you, otherwise the launcher will exit.<br/><br/>Do you "
"want to install it now?"
msgstr ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>The launcher "
"requires at least Java {0} to run.<br/><br/>The launcher can install this "
"automatically for you, otherwise the launcher will exit.<br/><br/>Do you "
"want to install it now?"

msgid ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>In the future the "
"launcher will no longer work without updating this.<br/><br/>This process is"
" automatic and doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the "
"launcher.<br/><br/>Do you want to do it now?"
msgstr ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>In the future the "
"launcher will no longer work without updating this.<br/><br/>This process is"
" automatic and doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the "
"launcher.<br/><br/>Do you want to do it now?"

msgid "Let Launcher Manage Java"
msgstr "Let Launcher управляет Java"

msgid ""
"You're currently using a version of Java not managed by the "
"launcher.<br/><br/>Letting the launcher manage it's own version of Java is "
"better for support and ease of use.<br/><br/>This process is automatic and "
"doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the launcher.<br/><br/>Do you "
"want to let the launcher manage it's own version of Java?"
msgstr ""
"You're currently using a version of Java not managed by the "
"launcher.<br/><br/>Letting the launcher manage it's own version of Java is "
"better for support and ease of use.<br/><br/>This process is automatic and "
"doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the launcher.<br/><br/>Do you "
"want to let the launcher manage it's own version of Java?"

msgid "Downloading Java Update"
msgstr "Скачать Java Update"

msgid "Failed To Update Bundled JRE"
msgstr "Не удалось обновить Bundled JRE"

msgid ""
"There was an issue updating the bundled JRE. Please try again later and if "
"the issue persists, please contact ATLauncher support via Discord."
msgstr ""
"Была проблема с обновлением пакета JRE. Пожалуйста, попробуйте еще раз "
"позже, и если проблема сохраняется, пожалуйста, свяжитесь с поддержкой "
"ATLauncher через Discord."

msgid ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java and the launcher will no "
"longer open.<br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, please "
"make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any older "
"versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>The launcher will now exit."
msgstr ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java and the launcher will no "
"longer open.<br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, please "
"make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any older "
"versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>The launcher will now exit."

msgid ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/><font "
"color=\"red\"><b>Soon the launcher will no longer open without updating "
"Java.</b></font><br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, "
"please make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any "
"older versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>Do you want to update Java"
" now?"
msgstr ""
"You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/><font "
"color=\"red\"><b>Soon the launcher will no longer open without updating "
"Java.</b></font><br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, "
"please make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any "
"older versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>Do you want to update Java"
" now?"

msgid "Don't remind me again"
msgstr "Не напоминайте мне снова"

msgid "ATLauncher installed within OneDrive"
msgstr "ATLauncher установлен в OneDrive"

msgid ""
"We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within "
"OneDrive.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the "
"folder outside of OneDrive.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and "
"do this now?"
msgstr ""
"We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within "
"OneDrive.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the "
"folder outside of OneDrive.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and "
"do this now?"

msgid "ATLauncher installed within Program Files"
msgstr "ATLauncher установлен в файлах программы"

msgid ""
"We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within Program "
"Files.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the folder"
" outside of Program Files.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and do"
" this now?"
msgstr ""
"We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within Program "
"Files.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the folder"
" outside of Program Files.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and do"
" this now?"

msgid "ATLauncher cannot write files"
msgstr "ATLauncher не умеет писать файлы"

msgid ""
"We have detected that ATLauncher cannot write files in it's current "
"location.<br/><br/>We cannot continue to run, you must move this folder "
"somewhere else with write access.<br/><br/>Try moving to a folder in your "
"Desktop or another drive.<br/><br/>You can also try running ATLauncher as "
"administrator, but this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"We have detected that ATLauncher cannot write files in it's current "
"location.<br/><br/>We cannot continue to run, you must move this folder "
"somewhere else with write access.<br/><br/>Try moving to a folder in your "
"Desktop or another drive.<br/><br/>You can also try running ATLauncher as "
"administrator, but this is not recommended."

